my ATM card wouldn't work

01:00:43.810 --> 01:00:44.713
for three hours.

01:00:45.555 --> 01:00:46.890
Did you straighten that out?

01:00:46.890 --> 01:00:48.290
Straightened it out, yeah.

01:00:49.439 --> 01:00:51.960
But we took a canal tour.

01:00:51.960 --> 01:00:55.071
There's lots of canals
off of the main river

01:00:55.071 --> 01:00:58.370
