01:01:38.240 --> 01:01:40.300
I call it a Komodo dragon
but that's not what it was.

01:01:40.300 --> 01:01:42.150
Komodo dragons, they're
dangerous for real.

01:01:42.150 --> 01:01:43.653
It wasn't a Komodo dragon.

01:01:45.360 --> 01:01:47.820
But then that night, that second night,

01:01:47.820 --> 01:01:48.793
it hit me.

01:01:50.590 --> 01:01:51.783
It hasn't hit me.

01:01:53.050 --> 01:01:55.790
Digestively, you know what I'm saying?

01:01:55.790 --> 01:01:58.483
Yeah.
I'm not having any movement.

