01:02:31.710 --> 01:02:33.535
And I took my breakfast--
Travel though.

01:02:33.535 --> 01:02:35.880
Smoothie pack but I
didn't take my flaxseed.

01:02:35.880 --> 01:02:38.170
That was a big mistake, man.
Yeah.

01:02:38.170 --> 01:02:41.615
And you know, with my
