01:03:23.030 --> 01:03:26.241
Nothing, and I could just
feel that there was like--

01:03:26.241 --> 01:03:27.843
Oh gosh.

01:03:27.843 --> 01:03:29.563
I was getting bottom heavy.

01:03:30.410 --> 01:03:31.743
It's just not good, man.

01:03:33.571 --> 01:03:36.003
So we're at the end of,

01:03:37.010 --> 01:03:39.970
