You're eating a lot of rice, right?

01:07:00.830 --> 01:07:01.910
Rice, noodles.

01:07:01.910 --> 01:07:04.140
Rice and noodles, yeah,
you gotta balance that out.

01:07:04.140 --> 01:07:05.450
Meats.

01:07:05.450 --> 01:07:06.283
But--

01:07:06.283 --> 01:07:07.360
Not a lot of fiber in any of that.

01:07:07.360 --> 01:07:08.920
Not a lot of fiber.

01:07:08.920 --> 01:07:12.480
But I became, it's like it shut down.

01:07:12.480 --> 01:07:14.640
My intestines just shut down.

